{"id":"boundary_issue_not_action_001","chunk_id":"boundary_issue_not_action_001","title":"遗留问题不得自动转化为待办","content":"能力缺失、机制未建立、方案未敲定或条件不足只能证明存在遗留问题。除非会议明确形成具体动作并存在承诺、指派、接受或确认安排，否则不得根据常识将遗留问题自动改写成待办。","metadata":{"runtime_layer":"POLICY_FIXED","layer":"boundary","scenario":"all","dimension":"cross_dimension","knowledge_type":"boundary_rule","priority":"critical","version":"2.1.1","dataset_version":"meeting_analyst_rag_v2_1_1","chunk_schema_version":"rag-chunk-v2.1.1","expert_review_version":"final-expert-v5","status":"approved"}}
{"id":"boundary_rule_001","chunk_id":"boundary_rule_001","title":"议程与总结边界","content":"会议议程回答讨论什么、按什么顺序推进；会议总结回答实际讨论了什么、有哪些分歧、取舍和整体结果。议程不得承载结论、待办、遗留问题或风险。","metadata":{"runtime_layer":"RAG_DYNAMIC","layer":"boundary","scenario":"all","dimension":"cross_dimension","knowledge_type":"boundary_rule","priority":"high","version":"2.1.1","dataset_version":"meeting_analyst_rag_v2_1_1","chunk_schema_version":"rag-chunk-v2.1.1","expert_review_version":"final-expert-v5","status":"approved"}}
{"id":"boundary_rule_002","chunk_id":"boundary_rule_002","title":"总结与结论边界","content":"会议总结覆盖过程全貌，核心结论只保留已确认的决定。总结可以描述讨论和取舍；结论必须有明确确认、接受、敲定或执行信号支撑。","metadata":{"runtime_layer":"RAG_DYNAMIC","layer":"boundary","scenario":"all","dimension":"cross_dimension","knowledge_type":"boundary_rule","priority":"high","version":"2.1.1","dataset_version":"meeting_analyst_rag_v2_1_1","chunk_schema_version":"rag-chunk-v2.1.1","expert_review_version":"final-expert-v5","status":"approved"}}
{"id":"boundary_rule_003","chunk_id":"boundary_rule_003","title":"结论与待办边界","content":"方向性决定、规则性共识和范围取舍属于核心结论；具体执行动作属于待办。同一句规则性共识不得原样复制为待办，除非会议另行形成了具体执行安排。","metadata":{"runtime_layer":"POLICY_FIXED","layer":"boundary","scenario":"all","dimension":"cross_dimension","knowledge_type":"boundary_rule","priority":"high","version":"2.1.1","dataset_version":"meeting_analyst_rag_v2_1_1","chunk_schema_version":"rag-chunk-v2.1.1","expert_review_version":"final-expert-v5","status":"approved"}}
{"id":"boundary_rule_004","chunk_id":"boundary_rule_004","title":"待办与遗留问题边界","content":"有明确动作并存在承诺、指派、接受或会议确认安排的事项属于待办；当前未闭环、无答案、无方案、无条件或无排期的事项属于遗留问题。缺少负责人或截止时间不自动等于遗留问题。","metadata":{"runtime_layer":"POLICY_FIXED","layer":"boundary","scenario":"all","dimension":"cross_dimension","knowledge_type":"boundary_rule","priority":"high","version":"2.1.1","dataset_version":"meeting_analyst_rag_v2_1_1","chunk_schema_version":"rag-chunk-v2.1.1","expert_review_version":"final-expert-v5","status":"approved"}}
{"id":"boundary_rule_005","chunk_id":"boundary_rule_005","title":"遗留问题与风险边界","content":"遗留问题是当前已经存在且尚未解决的卡点；风险是未来可能发生的不利事件及影响。两者可以存在因果关联，但不得混为同一项。","metadata":{"runtime_layer":"POLICY_FIXED","layer":"boundary","scenario":"all","dimension":"cross_dimension","knowledge_type":"boundary_rule","priority":"high","version":"2.1.1","dataset_version":"meeting_analyst_rag_v2_1_1","chunk_schema_version":"rag-chunk-v2.1.1","expert_review_version":"final-expert-v5","status":"approved"}}
{"id":"boundary_rule_006","chunk_id":"boundary_rule_006","title":"待办与风险边界","content":"待办描述已经确认需要执行的动作；风险描述未来可能发生的不利事件及影响。应对措施只有在会议明确决定或接受执行时，才可成为待办。","metadata":{"runtime_layer":"POLICY_FIXED","layer":"boundary","scenario":"all","dimension":"cross_dimension","knowledge_type":"boundary_rule","priority":"high","version":"2.1.1","dataset_version":"meeting_analyst_rag_v2_1_1","chunk_schema_version":"rag-chunk-v2.1.1","expert_review_version":"final-expert-v5","status":"approved"}}
{"id":"boundary_rule_007","chunk_id":"boundary_rule_007","title":"背景与遗留问题边界","content":"投诉、现象和业务背景本身不自动属于遗留问题。只有会议结束时仍存在具体未闭环点，且没有明确答案、解决结论或足以闭环的执行安排时，才归入遗留问题。","metadata":{"runtime_layer":"RAG_DYNAMIC","layer":"boundary","scenario":"all","dimension":"unresolved_issues","knowledge_type":"boundary_rule","priority":"high","version":"2.1.1","dataset_version":"meeting_analyst_rag_v2_1_1","chunk_schema_version":"rag-chunk-v2.1.1","expert_review_version":"final-expert-v5","status":"approved"}}
{"id":"boundary_rule_008","chunk_id":"boundary_rule_008","title":"建议与结论边界","content":"建议、提议、假设和备选方案只有在会议中出现明确同意、确认、敲定、按此执行或其他等价接受信号后，才能升级为核心结论。沉默、未反对和话题切换不等于共识。","metadata":{"runtime_layer":"POLICY_FIXED","layer":"boundary","scenario":"all","dimension":"key_conclusions","knowledge_type":"boundary_rule","priority":"high","version":"2.1.1","dataset_version":"meeting_analyst_rag_v2_1_1","chunk_schema_version":"rag-chunk-v2.1.1","expert_review_version":"final-expert-v5","status":"approved"}}
{"id":"boundary_rule_009","chunk_id":"boundary_rule_009","title":"提问与遗留问题边界","content":"会议中的疑问不等于遗留问题。如果问题在会议中得到回答或形成处理方案，则不进入遗留问题；只有会后仍无答案、无方案或被搁置的问题才属于遗留问题。","metadata":{"runtime_layer":"RAG_DYNAMIC","layer":"boundary","scenario":"all","dimension":"unresolved_issues","knowledge_type":"boundary_rule","priority":"high","version":"2.1.1","dataset_version":"meeting_analyst_rag_v2_1_1","chunk_schema_version":"rag-chunk-v2.1.1","expert_review_version":"final-expert-v5","status":"approved"}}
{"id":"boundary_rule_010","chunk_id":"boundary_rule_010","title":"总结禁止原文拼接","content":"会议总结必须对整场会议进行归纳重写，不能将多句原始发言直接拼接成总结。总结应体现背景、讨论、分歧、取舍和整体结果之间的逻辑关系。","metadata":{"runtime_layer":"RAG_DYNAMIC","layer":"boundary","scenario":"all","dimension":"meeting_summary","knowledge_type":"boundary_rule","priority":"high","version":"2.1.1","dataset_version":"meeting_analyst_rag_v2_1_1","chunk_schema_version":"rag-chunk-v2.1.1","expert_review_version":"final-expert-v5","status":"approved"}}
{"id":"boundary_rule_011","chunk_id":"boundary_rule_011","title":"跨维度语义角色规则","content":"同一业务事实可以支撑不同维度，但输出必须体现不同语义角色。例如推荐功能延期可作为结论；缺少行为数据体系可作为遗留问题，但不能把完全相同句子重复放入两个维度。","metadata":{"runtime_layer":"RAG_DYNAMIC","layer":"boundary","scenario":"all","dimension":"cross_dimension","knowledge_type":"boundary_rule","priority":"high","version":"2.1.1","dataset_version":"meeting_analyst_rag_v2_1_1","chunk_schema_version":"rag-chunk-v2.1.1","expert_review_version":"final-expert-v5","status":"approved"}}
{"id":"boundary_rule_012","chunk_id":"boundary_rule_012","title":"证据优先规则","content":"所有核心结论、待办、遗留问题和风险必须能够追溯到当前会议原文。RAG 示例只用于理解判断规则，不得迁移为当前会议事实；负责人、时间、结论和风险不确定时保持空值或不输出。","metadata":{"runtime_layer":"POLICY_FIXED","layer":"boundary","scenario":"all","dimension":"evidence","knowledge_type":"boundary_rule","priority":"high","version":"2.1.1","dataset_version":"meeting_analyst_rag_v2_1_1","chunk_schema_version":"rag-chunk-v2.1.1","expert_review_version":"final-expert-v5","status":"approved"}}
{"id":"boundary_speaker_owner_001","chunk_id":"boundary_speaker_owner_001","title":"说话人不等于待办负责人","content":"提出、要求或描述任务的人不一定是负责人。负责人必须依据动作指向、明确承诺、接受任务或角色指派判断；无法确定具体人时保留角色级负责人或 null，不得自动把说话人写为 owner。","metadata":{"runtime_layer":"POLICY_FIXED","layer":"boundary","scenario":"all","dimension":"action_items","knowledge_type":"boundary_rule","priority":"critical","version":"2.1.1","dataset_version":"meeting_analyst_rag_v2_1_1","chunk_schema_version":"rag-chunk-v2.1.1","expert_review_version":"final-expert-v5","status":"approved"}}
{"id":"definition_001","chunk_id":"definition_001","title":"会议议程定义","content":"会议议程描述会议计划或实际采用的讨论主题、推进顺序和沟通框架。只提取依次同步、评估、讨论或确认的主题，不写讨论过程细节、最终决策、执行任务、遗留问题或风险。","metadata":{"runtime_layer":"POLICY_FIXED","layer":"base","scenario":"all","dimension":"meeting_agenda","knowledge_type":"definition","priority":"high","version":"2.1.1","dataset_version":"meeting_analyst_rag_v2_1_1","chunk_schema_version":"rag-chunk-v2.1.1","expert_review_version":"final-expert-v5","status":"approved"}}
{"id":"definition_002","chunk_id":"definition_002","title":"会议总结定义","content":"会议总结是对整场会议背景、核心话题、主要讨论过程、分歧、取舍和整体结果的连贯归纳。必须重新组织表达，不直接拼接原始发言，也不把结论、待办、遗留问题和风险清单重复一遍。","metadata":{"runtime_layer":"POLICY_FIXED","layer":"base","scenario":"all","dimension":"meeting_summary","knowledge_type":"definition","priority":"high","version":"2.1.1","dataset_version":"meeting_analyst_rag_v2_1_1","chunk_schema_version":"rag-chunk-v2.1.1","expert_review_version":"final-expert-v5","status":"approved"}}
{"id":"definition_003","chunk_id":"definition_003","title":"核心结论定义","content":"核心结论是会议中已被明确接受、确认、敲定或形成共识的方向性决定、范围取舍、规则或阶段性安排。建议、假设、单方观点、沉默和无人回应的提议均不能作为核心结论；具体执行动作不属于结论本体。","metadata":{"runtime_layer":"POLICY_FIXED","layer":"base","scenario":"all","dimension":"key_conclusions","knowledge_type":"definition","priority":"high","version":"2.1.1","dataset_version":"meeting_analyst_rag_v2_1_1","chunk_schema_version":"rag-chunk-v2.1.1","expert_review_version":"final-expert-v5","status":"approved"}}
{"id":"definition_004","chunk_id":"definition_004","title":"待办与后续安排定义","content":"待办与后续安排是会议中已经形成明确执行安排的具体动作。至少应存在明确承诺、明确指派、接受任务或会议确认的执行要求之一；单纯的‘需要、建议、最好、可以研究’不足以形成待办。负责人和截止时间可以缺失，但不得凭空补全。","metadata":{"runtime_layer":"POLICY_FIXED","layer":"base","scenario":"all","dimension":"action_items","knowledge_type":"definition","priority":"high","version":"2.1.1","dataset_version":"meeting_analyst_rag_v2_1_1","chunk_schema_version":"rag-chunk-v2.1.1","expert_review_version":"final-expert-v5","status":"approved"}}
{"id":"definition_005","chunk_id":"definition_005","title":"遗留问题定义","content":"遗留问题是会议结束时仍未闭环的当前问题，包括尚无答案、方案、条件、权限、机制或排期的事项。已有明确执行安排时，动作进入待办；只有执行安排之外仍未闭环的部分，才继续保留为遗留问题。","metadata":{"runtime_layer":"POLICY_FIXED","layer":"base","scenario":"all","dimension":"unresolved_issues","knowledge_type":"definition","priority":"high","version":"2.1.1","dataset_version":"meeting_analyst_rag_v2_1_1","chunk_schema_version":"rag-chunk-v2.1.1","expert_review_version":"final-expert-v5","status":"approved"}}
{"id":"definition_006","chunk_id":"definition_006","title":"风险与关注点定义","content":"风险描述未来可能发生的不利事件及其影响，通常包含触发条件、潜在事件或影响结果。当前已经发生的问题优先归入遗留问题；一般背景事实不得作为风险。只有会议明确要求持续监控、复查或关注的事项，才可作为关注点。","metadata":{"runtime_layer":"POLICY_FIXED","layer":"base","scenario":"all","dimension":"risks_and_focus","knowledge_type":"definition","priority":"high","version":"2.1.1","dataset_version":"meeting_analyst_rag_v2_1_1","chunk_schema_version":"rag-chunk-v2.1.1","expert_review_version":"final-expert-v5","status":"approved"}}
{"id":"negative_example_001","chunk_id":"negative_example_001","title":"反例：痛点当遗留问题","content":"错误：把批量下载卡顿直接归入遗留问题。原因：这是背景和当前痛点，除非会议明确确认本次无法解决或搁置，否则不能判为遗留问题。","metadata":{"runtime_layer":"RAG_DYNAMIC","layer":"boundary","scenario":"all","dimension":"unresolved_issues","knowledge_type":"negative_example","priority":"high","version":"2.1.1","dataset_version":"meeting_analyst_rag_v2_1_1","chunk_schema_version":"rag-chunk-v2.1.1","expert_review_version":"final-expert-v5","status":"approved"}}
{"id":"negative_example_002","chunk_id":"negative_example_002","title":"反例：建议当结论","content":"错误：研发说建议冻结需求后立即归入核心结论。原因：建议尚未被接受；只有明确同意并确认后才能生成结论。","metadata":{"runtime_layer":"RAG_DYNAMIC","layer":"boundary","scenario":"all","dimension":"key_conclusions","knowledge_type":"negative_example","priority":"high","version":"2.1.1","dataset_version":"meeting_analyst_rag_v2_1_1","chunk_schema_version":"rag-chunk-v2.1.1","expert_review_version":"final-expert-v5","status":"approved"}}
{"id":"negative_example_003","chunk_id":"negative_example_003","title":"反例：待办当遗留问题","content":"错误：产品后续补充标签规则归入遗留问题。原因：已有明确执行动作和责任主体。正确分类：待办与后续安排。","metadata":{"runtime_layer":"RAG_DYNAMIC","layer":"boundary","scenario":"all","dimension":"cross_dimension","knowledge_type":"negative_example","priority":"high","version":"2.1.1","dataset_version":"meeting_analyst_rag_v2_1_1","chunk_schema_version":"rag-chunk-v2.1.1","expert_review_version":"final-expert-v5","status":"approved"}}
{"id":"negative_example_004","chunk_id":"negative_example_004","title":"反例：风险当待办","content":"错误：高频下载可能造成服务器压力归入待办。正确分类：风险；制定下载频率限制才是待办。","metadata":{"runtime_layer":"RAG_DYNAMIC","layer":"boundary","scenario":"all","dimension":"cross_dimension","knowledge_type":"negative_example","priority":"high","version":"2.1.1","dataset_version":"meeting_analyst_rag_v2_1_1","chunk_schema_version":"rag-chunk-v2.1.1","expert_review_version":"final-expert-v5","status":"approved"}}
{"id":"negative_example_005","chunk_id":"negative_example_005","title":"反例：总结复制原话","content":"错误：把多句原始发言直接拼接成会议总结。正确做法：归纳会议背景、讨论过程、取舍和整体结果，形成连贯全景概括。","metadata":{"runtime_layer":"RAG_DYNAMIC","layer":"boundary","scenario":"all","dimension":"meeting_summary","knowledge_type":"negative_example","priority":"high","version":"2.1.1","dataset_version":"meeting_analyst_rag_v2_1_1","chunk_schema_version":"rag-chunk-v2.1.1","expert_review_version":"final-expert-v5","status":"approved"}}
{"id":"negative_example_006","chunk_id":"negative_example_006","title":"反例：结论待办重复","content":"错误：将需求冻结既写为核心结论，又把完全相同内容写入待办。正确做法：规则性共识归入核心结论；只有具体执行动作才进入待办。","metadata":{"runtime_layer":"RAG_DYNAMIC","layer":"boundary","scenario":"all","dimension":"cross_dimension","knowledge_type":"negative_example","priority":"high","version":"2.1.1","dataset_version":"meeting_analyst_rag_v2_1_1","chunk_schema_version":"rag-chunk-v2.1.1","expert_review_version":"final-expert-v5","status":"approved"}}
{"id":"negative_example_007","chunk_id":"negative_example_007","title":"反例：已解决问题仍遗留","content":"错误：旧数据是否兼容已明确决定必须102%兼容，却仍列为遗留问题。正确处理：问题已闭环，不进入遗留问题。","metadata":{"runtime_layer":"RAG_DYNAMIC","layer":"boundary","scenario":"all","dimension":"unresolved_issues","knowledge_type":"negative_example","priority":"high","version":"2.1.1","dataset_version":"meeting_analyst_rag_v2_1_1","chunk_schema_version":"rag-chunk-v2.1.1","expert_review_version":"final-expert-v5","status":"approved"}}
{"id":"negative_example_008","chunk_id":"negative_example_008","title":"反例：编造负责人","content":"错误：会议只说需要补充迁移方案，模型自行指定研发负责人。正确做法：原文没有明确责任人时 owner_name 返回 null。","metadata":{"runtime_layer":"RAG_DYNAMIC","layer":"boundary","scenario":"all","dimension":"action_items","knowledge_type":"negative_example","priority":"high","version":"2.1.1","dataset_version":"meeting_analyst_rag_v2_1_1","chunk_schema_version":"rag-chunk-v2.1.1","expert_review_version":"final-expert-v5","status":"approved"}}
{"id":"negative_example_009","chunk_id":"negative_example_009","title":"反例：编造风险","content":"错误：会议未讨论安全、隐私或成本，却自动生成数据泄露或成本超支风险。正确做法：风险必须有会议证据或可解释证据链。","metadata":{"runtime_layer":"RAG_DYNAMIC","layer":"boundary","scenario":"all","dimension":"risks_and_focus","knowledge_type":"negative_example","priority":"high","version":"2.1.1","dataset_version":"meeting_analyst_rag_v2_1_1","chunk_schema_version":"rag-chunk-v2.1.1","expert_review_version":"final-expert-v5","status":"approved"}}
{"id":"negative_example_010","chunk_id":"negative_example_010","title":"反例：重复待办","content":"错误：后续搭建数据体系后再排期推荐功能被拆成多条相同待办。正确做法：若暂无明确执行承诺和排期，应归入遗留问题并合并重复表达。","metadata":{"runtime_layer":"RAG_DYNAMIC","layer":"boundary","scenario":"all","dimension":"cross_dimension","knowledge_type":"negative_example","priority":"high","version":"2.1.1","dataset_version":"meeting_analyst_rag_v2_1_1","chunk_schema_version":"rag-chunk-v2.1.1","expert_review_version":"final-expert-v5","status":"approved"}}
{"id":"positive_example_001","chunk_id":"positive_example_001","title":"议程正例：需求评审","content":"先同步用户痛点和版本目标，再逐项评估需求技术可行性，随后确认版本范围、上线时间和风险。正确分类：会议议程，因为描述会议推进顺序与讨论框架。","metadata":{"runtime_layer":"RAG_SCENARIO","layer":"scenario","scenario":"requirement_review","dimension":"meeting_agenda","knowledge_type":"positive_example","priority":"high","version":"2.1.1","dataset_version":"meeting_analyst_rag_v2_1_1","chunk_schema_version":"rag-chunk-v2.1.1","expert_review_version":"final-expert-v5","status":"approved"}}
{"id":"positive_example_002","chunk_id":"positive_example_002","title":"议程正例：项目复盘","content":"先回顾目标完成情况，再分析延期原因，然后讨论改进措施，最后确认下一阶段计划。正确分类：会议议程。","metadata":{"runtime_layer":"RAG_SCENARIO","layer":"scenario","scenario":"project_retrospective","dimension":"meeting_agenda","knowledge_type":"positive_example","priority":"high","version":"2.1.1","dataset_version":"meeting_analyst_rag_v2_1_1","chunk_schema_version":"rag-chunk-v2.1.1","expert_review_version":"final-expert-v5","status":"approved"}}
{"id":"positive_example_003","chunk_id":"positive_example_003","title":"总结正例：需求取舍","content":"会议围绕V2.2需求范围评审，产品提出三项需求，研发指出推荐功能缺少数据基础。双方据此缩减版本范围，并确认历史数据兼容、上线时间和需求冻结要求。正确分类：会议总结。","metadata":{"runtime_layer":"RAG_SCENARIO","layer":"scenario","scenario":"requirement_review","dimension":"meeting_summary","knowledge_type":"positive_example","priority":"high","version":"2.1.1","dataset_version":"meeting_analyst_rag_v2_1_1","chunk_schema_version":"rag-chunk-v2.1.1","expert_review_version":"final-expert-v5","status":"approved"}}
{"id":"positive_example_004","chunk_id":"positive_example_004","title":"总结正例：进度会议","content":"会议围绕开发进度、接口阻塞和测试准备展开。研发同步核心功能已完成但第三方接口仍延迟，测试提出提前准备回归环境，双方调整联调顺序并明确协作方式。正确分类：会议总结。","metadata":{"runtime_layer":"RAG_SCENARIO","layer":"scenario","scenario":"project_weekly","dimension":"meeting_summary","knowledge_type":"positive_example","priority":"high","version":"2.1.1","dataset_version":"meeting_analyst_rag_v2_1_1","chunk_schema_version":"rag-chunk-v2.1.1","expert_review_version":"final-expert-v5","status":"approved"}}
{"id":"positive_example_005","chunk_id":"positive_example_005","title":"结论正例：取消需求","content":"会议明确确认V2.2版本不再上线个性化推荐功能，待用户行为数据体系完善后另行排期。正确分类：核心结论。","metadata":{"runtime_layer":"RAG_SCENARIO","layer":"scenario","scenario":"release_planning","dimension":"key_conclusions","knowledge_type":"positive_example","priority":"high","version":"2.1.1","dataset_version":"meeting_analyst_rag_v2_1_1","chunk_schema_version":"rag-chunk-v2.1.1","expert_review_version":"final-expert-v5","status":"approved"}}
{"id":"positive_example_006","chunk_id":"positive_example_006","title":"结论正例：需求冻结","content":"双方确认需求正式冻结，开发期间不接受临时规则和逻辑变更。正确分类：核心结论。","metadata":{"runtime_layer":"RAG_SCENARIO","layer":"scenario","scenario":"release_planning","dimension":"key_conclusions","knowledge_type":"positive_example","priority":"high","version":"2.1.1","dataset_version":"meeting_analyst_rag_v2_1_1","chunk_schema_version":"rag-chunk-v2.1.1","expert_review_version":"final-expert-v5","status":"approved"}}
{"id":"positive_example_007","chunk_id":"positive_example_007","title":"结论正例：上线时间","content":"研发说明调整范围后整体周期约20天，参会方明确确认并接受8月3日前上线的节奏。正确分类：核心结论。若只有研发单方估算、未被会议确认，则不得作为核心结论。","metadata":{"runtime_layer":"RAG_SCENARIO","layer":"scenario","scenario":"release_planning","dimension":"key_conclusions","knowledge_type":"positive_example","priority":"high","version":"2.1.1","dataset_version":"meeting_analyst_rag_v2_1_1","chunk_schema_version":"rag-chunk-v2.1.1","expert_review_version":"final-expert-v5","status":"approved"}}
{"id":"positive_example_008","chunk_id":"positive_example_008","title":"待办正例：补充规则","content":"产品明确表示会将默认标签分组规则和批量下载频率限制阈值补充到需求文档。正确分类：待办与后续安排。","metadata":{"runtime_layer":"RAG_SCENARIO","layer":"scenario","scenario":"requirement_review","dimension":"action_items","knowledge_type":"positive_example","priority":"high","version":"2.1.1","dataset_version":"meeting_analyst_rag_v2_1_1","chunk_schema_version":"rag-chunk-v2.1.1","expert_review_version":"final-expert-v5","status":"approved"}}
{"id":"positive_example_009","chunk_id":"positive_example_009","title":"待办正例：开发实施","content":"研发将在需求定稿后开展接口优化、标签体系重构、历史数据适配和页面优化开发与自测。正确分类：待办与后续安排。","metadata":{"runtime_layer":"RAG_SCENARIO","layer":"scenario","scenario":"technical_review","dimension":"action_items","knowledge_type":"positive_example","priority":"high","version":"2.1.1","dataset_version":"meeting_analyst_rag_v2_1_1","chunk_schema_version":"rag-chunk-v2.1.1","expert_review_version":"final-expert-v5","status":"approved"}}
{"id":"positive_example_010","chunk_id":"positive_example_010","title":"待办正例：无截止时间","content":"会议确认运营需要整理用户反馈分类并提交给产品，但未明确截止时间。正确分类仍为待办，deadline 应为空。","metadata":{"runtime_layer":"RAG_SCENARIO","layer":"scenario","scenario":"project_weekly","dimension":"action_items","knowledge_type":"positive_example","priority":"high","version":"2.1.1","dataset_version":"meeting_analyst_rag_v2_1_1","chunk_schema_version":"rag-chunk-v2.1.1","expert_review_version":"final-expert-v5","status":"approved"}}
{"id":"positive_example_011","chunk_id":"positive_example_011","title":"遗留问题正例：数据体系缺失","content":"当前没有用户浏览、点击、收藏行为数据统计体系，因此无法支撑个性化推荐功能，且会议未给出建设排期。正确分类：遗留问题。","metadata":{"runtime_layer":"RAG_SCENARIO","layer":"scenario","scenario":"technical_review","dimension":"unresolved_issues","knowledge_type":"positive_example","priority":"high","version":"2.1.1","dataset_version":"meeting_analyst_rag_v2_1_1","chunk_schema_version":"rag-chunk-v2.1.1","expert_review_version":"final-expert-v5","status":"approved"}}
{"id":"positive_example_012","chunk_id":"positive_example_012","title":"遗留问题正例：外部依赖","content":"第三方接口权限尚未开放，当前没有明确开放时间，也没有替代方案。正确分类：遗留问题。","metadata":{"runtime_layer":"RAG_SCENARIO","layer":"scenario","scenario":"cross_team_coordination","dimension":"unresolved_issues","knowledge_type":"positive_example","priority":"high","version":"2.1.1","dataset_version":"meeting_analyst_rag_v2_1_1","chunk_schema_version":"rag-chunk-v2.1.1","expert_review_version":"final-expert-v5","status":"approved"}}
{"id":"positive_example_013","chunk_id":"positive_example_013","title":"风险正例：数据迁移返工","content":"如果数据迁移过程中临时修改标签规则或下载逻辑，可能导致适配返工并延误上线。正确分类：风险与关注点。","metadata":{"runtime_layer":"RAG_SCENARIO","layer":"scenario","scenario":"technical_review","dimension":"risks_and_focus","knowledge_type":"positive_example","priority":"high","version":"2.1.1","dataset_version":"meeting_analyst_rag_v2_1_1","chunk_schema_version":"rag-chunk-v2.1.1","expert_review_version":"final-expert-v5","status":"approved"}}
{"id":"positive_example_014","chunk_id":"positive_example_014","title":"风险正例：服务器压力","content":"批量下载如果缺少频率限制，高频请求可能导致服务器压力过大和功能异常。正确分类：风险与关注点。","metadata":{"runtime_layer":"RAG_SCENARIO","layer":"scenario","scenario":"technical_review","dimension":"risks_and_focus","knowledge_type":"positive_example","priority":"high","version":"2.1.1","dataset_version":"meeting_analyst_rag_v2_1_1","chunk_schema_version":"rag-chunk-v2.1.1","expert_review_version":"final-expert-v5","status":"approved"}}
{"id":"positive_example_015","chunk_id":"positive_example_015","title":"风险正例：交付风险","content":"项目有明确交付日期，关键任务尚无人承接，会议同时指出无人跟进可能导致延期。正确分类：风险与关注点；不得根据任务内容自行指定负责人。","metadata":{"runtime_layer":"RAG_SCENARIO","layer":"scenario","scenario":"project_weekly","dimension":"risks_and_focus","knowledge_type":"positive_example","priority":"high","version":"2.1.1","dataset_version":"meeting_analyst_rag_v2_1_1","chunk_schema_version":"rag-chunk-v2.1.1","expert_review_version":"final-expert-v5","status":"approved"}}
{"id":"positive_example_016","chunk_id":"positive_example_016","title":"风险正例：测试覆盖","content":"上线窗口固定但回归测试时间被压缩，可能导致缺陷遗漏。正确分类：风险与关注点。","metadata":{"runtime_layer":"RAG_SCENARIO","layer":"scenario","scenario":"release_planning","dimension":"risks_and_focus","knowledge_type":"positive_example","priority":"high","version":"2.1.1","dataset_version":"meeting_analyst_rag_v2_1_1","chunk_schema_version":"rag-chunk-v2.1.1","expert_review_version":"final-expert-v5","status":"approved"}}
{"id":"reasoning_pattern_001","chunk_id":"reasoning_pattern_001","title":"推理：数据缺失导致需求阻塞","content":"只有会议原文同时明确功能依赖、依赖条件当前缺失，以及该缺失导致无法推进或需要延期时，才能归纳需求阻塞或暂缓。不得仅凭技术常识补充 blocked、deferred 等状态。","metadata":{"runtime_layer":"RAG_SCENARIO","layer":"scenario","scenario":"technical_review","dimension":"unresolved_issues","knowledge_type":"reasoning_pattern","priority":"high","version":"2.1.1","dataset_version":"meeting_analyst_rag_v2_1_1","chunk_schema_version":"rag-chunk-v2.1.1","expert_review_version":"final-expert-v5","status":"approved"}}
{"id":"reasoning_pattern_002","chunk_id":"reasoning_pattern_002","title":"推理：限流缺失导致容量风险","content":"识别容量或稳定性风险时，应有会议证据支持请求规模或高频特征、限制机制缺失，以及潜在影响中的至少两部分；不得仅因出现‘批量下载’就自动推导服务器故障。","metadata":{"runtime_layer":"RAG_SCENARIO","layer":"scenario","scenario":"technical_review","dimension":"risks_and_focus","knowledge_type":"reasoning_pattern","priority":"high","version":"2.1.1","dataset_version":"meeting_analyst_rag_v2_1_1","chunk_schema_version":"rag-chunk-v2.1.1","expert_review_version":"final-expert-v5","status":"approved"}}
{"id":"reasoning_pattern_003","chunk_id":"reasoning_pattern_003","title":"推理：规则变更导致返工","content":"识别迁移返工风险时，原文应明确存在迁移或兼容工作、规则或结构可能变化，以及变化会造成重新适配或延期。不得仅凭‘迁移’一词自动生成返工风险。","metadata":{"runtime_layer":"RAG_SCENARIO","layer":"scenario","scenario":"technical_review","dimension":"risks_and_focus","knowledge_type":"reasoning_pattern","priority":"high","version":"2.1.1","dataset_version":"meeting_analyst_rag_v2_1_1","chunk_schema_version":"rag-chunk-v2.1.1","expert_review_version":"final-expert-v5","status":"approved"}}
{"id":"reasoning_pattern_004","chunk_id":"reasoning_pattern_004","title":"推理：固定截止日期但责任人缺失","content":"固定交付日期且关键任务无人承接时，只有会议明确指出无人跟进及其交付影响，才可提取跟进风险；不得自动指定负责人，也不得把所有无负责人的任务都判为风险。","metadata":{"runtime_layer":"RAG_SCENARIO","layer":"scenario","scenario":"project_weekly","dimension":"risks_and_focus","knowledge_type":"reasoning_pattern","priority":"high","version":"2.1.1","dataset_version":"meeting_analyst_rag_v2_1_1","chunk_schema_version":"rag-chunk-v2.1.1","expert_review_version":"final-expert-v5","status":"approved"}}
{"id":"technical_incident_boundary_001","chunk_id":"technical_incident_boundary_001","title":"技术故障复盘：根因未确认的分类边界","content":"故障现象已经发生，但具体根因尚未通过日志、监控、复现结果或其他直接证据确认时，应将“根因未确认”记录为遗留问题。排查假设、可能原因和待验证方向不得作为核心结论。只有会议明确确认根因后，才能提取根因结论。","metadata":{"runtime_layer":"RAG_SCENARIO","layer":"scenario","scenario":"technical_incident","dimension":"unresolved_issues","knowledge_type":"boundary_rule","priority":"high","version":"2.1.1","dataset_version":"meeting_analyst_rag_v2_1_1","chunk_schema_version":"rag-chunk-v2.1.1","expert_review_version":"stage6-approved-v2.1.1","status":"approved"}}
{"id":"technical_incident_boundary_002","chunk_id":"technical_incident_boundary_002","title":"技术故障复盘：止血措施、根因结论与后续待办","content":"增加监控、回滚、限流、重启或继续排查属于止血措施或后续待办，不等于已经确认故障根因。已发生的超时、错误率上升或服务不可用属于故障事实；未来可能再次发生及其影响才属于风险。只有会议明确确认执行某项措施时，该措施才能进入待办。","metadata":{"runtime_layer":"RAG_SCENARIO","layer":"scenario","scenario":"technical_incident","dimension":"cross_dimension","knowledge_type":"boundary_rule","priority":"high","version":"2.1.1","dataset_version":"meeting_analyst_rag_v2_1_1","chunk_schema_version":"rag-chunk-v2.1.1","expert_review_version":"stage6-approved-v2.1.1","status":"approved"}}
{"id":"v4_boundary_rule_008","chunk_id":"v4_boundary_rule_008","title":"边界：当前事实与风险边界-1","content":"当前已经发生的低转化、库存不足、权限缺失或机制缺失属于当前事实或遗留问题。只有会议明确讨论其未来可能触发的不利事件或影响时，才另外提取风险。","metadata":{"runtime_layer":"RAG_DYNAMIC","layer":"boundary","scenario":"all","dimension":"cross_dimension","knowledge_type":"boundary_rule","priority":"high","version":"2.1.1","dataset_version":"meeting_analyst_rag_v2_1_1","chunk_schema_version":"rag-chunk-v2.1.1","expert_review_version":"final-expert-v5","status":"approved"}}
{"id":"v4_boundary_rule_010","chunk_id":"v4_boundary_rule_010","title":"边界：会议级时间与任务截止时间边界-1","content":"项目整体上线时间、活动窗口和会议目标日期不能自动传播给所有待办。只有时间与具体任务处于同一语义单元，或通过清晰指代链明确绑定时，才能填写该任务的 deadline。","metadata":{"runtime_layer":"RAG_DYNAMIC","layer":"boundary","scenario":"all","dimension":"action_items","knowledge_type":"boundary_rule","priority":"high","version":"2.1.1","dataset_version":"meeting_analyst_rag_v2_1_1","chunk_schema_version":"rag-chunk-v2.1.1","expert_review_version":"final-expert-v5","status":"approved"}}
{"id":"v4_boundary_rule_012","chunk_id":"v4_boundary_rule_012","title":"边界：风险应对与风险本体边界-1","content":"风险本体描述未来可能发生的不利事件及影响；风险应对描述可能采取的动作。只有会议明确决定或接受执行某项应对措施时，该措施才进入待办。","metadata":{"runtime_layer":"RAG_DYNAMIC","layer":"boundary","scenario":"all","dimension":"cross_dimension","knowledge_type":"boundary_rule","priority":"high","version":"2.1.1","dataset_version":"meeting_analyst_rag_v2_1_1","chunk_schema_version":"rag-chunk-v2.1.1","expert_review_version":"final-expert-v5","status":"approved"}}
{"id":"v4_deadline_rule_001","chunk_id":"v4_deadline_rule_001","title":"时间：明确日期-1","content":"‘研发周五前完成联调’中，周五前与具体任务直接绑定，可保存原始时间表达；系统具备会议日期和时区时再标准化。","metadata":{"runtime_layer":"POLICY_FIXED","layer":"base","scenario":"all","dimension":"action_items","knowledge_type":"deadline_rule","priority":"high","version":"2.1.1","dataset_version":"meeting_analyst_rag_v2_1_1","chunk_schema_version":"rag-chunk-v2.1.1","expert_review_version":"final-expert-v5","status":"approved"}}
{"id":"v4_deadline_rule_002","chunk_id":"v4_deadline_rule_002","title":"时间：相对日期-1","content":"‘明天下午提交方案’应保留原始相对时间。只有系统具备会议日期和时区时才能解析为绝对时间；上下文不足时不得猜测。","metadata":{"runtime_layer":"POLICY_FIXED","layer":"base","scenario":"all","dimension":"action_items","knowledge_type":"deadline_rule","priority":"high","version":"2.1.1","dataset_version":"meeting_analyst_rag_v2_1_1","chunk_schema_version":"rag-chunk-v2.1.1","expert_review_version":"final-expert-v5","status":"approved"}}
{"id":"v4_deadline_rule_003","chunk_id":"v4_deadline_rule_003","title":"时间：会议级日期-1","content":"‘版本8月3日上线’是项目级里程碑，不能自动成为所有任务的 deadline。任务时间必须有任务级绑定证据。","metadata":{"runtime_layer":"POLICY_FIXED","layer":"base","scenario":"all","dimension":"action_items","knowledge_type":"deadline_rule","priority":"high","version":"2.1.1","dataset_version":"meeting_analyst_rag_v2_1_1","chunk_schema_version":"rag-chunk-v2.1.1","expert_review_version":"final-expert-v5","status":"approved"}}
{"id":"v4_deadline_rule_004","chunk_id":"v4_deadline_rule_004","title":"时间：条件时间-1","content":"‘依赖资料完成后上线’属于条件触发时间，应保留条件表达，不得伪造具体日期。","metadata":{"runtime_layer":"POLICY_FIXED","layer":"base","scenario":"all","dimension":"action_items","knowledge_type":"deadline_rule","priority":"high","version":"2.1.1","dataset_version":"meeting_analyst_rag_v2_1_1","chunk_schema_version":"rag-chunk-v2.1.1","expert_review_version":"final-expert-v5","status":"approved"}}
{"id":"v4_deadline_rule_005","chunk_id":"v4_deadline_rule_005","title":"时间：无时间-1","content":"任务已经明确但会议未给出时间时，deadline 为 null；缺少时间不影响其待办分类。","metadata":{"runtime_layer":"POLICY_FIXED","layer":"base","scenario":"all","dimension":"action_items","knowledge_type":"deadline_rule","priority":"high","version":"2.1.1","dataset_version":"meeting_analyst_rag_v2_1_1","chunk_schema_version":"rag-chunk-v2.1.1","expert_review_version":"final-expert-v5","status":"approved"}}
{"id":"v4_negative_example_001","chunk_id":"v4_negative_example_001","title":"反例：把建议当结论-1","content":"错误：有人说‘建议降价’就输出‘确定降价’。正确：没有确认信号时，不能进入核心结论。","metadata":{"runtime_layer":"RAG_DYNAMIC","layer":"boundary","scenario":"all","dimension":"key_conclusions","knowledge_type":"negative_example","priority":"high","version":"2.1.1","dataset_version":"meeting_analyst_rag_v2_1_1","chunk_schema_version":"rag-chunk-v2.1.1","expert_review_version":"final-expert-v5","status":"approved"}}
{"id":"v4_negative_example_002","chunk_id":"v4_negative_example_002","title":"反例：把遗留问题自动变待办-1","content":"错误：原文只有‘没有差评监控机制’，却生成‘建立差评监控机制’待办。正确：仅归入遗留问题。","metadata":{"runtime_layer":"RAG_DYNAMIC","layer":"boundary","scenario":"all","dimension":"cross_dimension","knowledge_type":"negative_example","priority":"high","version":"2.1.1","dataset_version":"meeting_analyst_rag_v2_1_1","chunk_schema_version":"rag-chunk-v2.1.1","expert_review_version":"final-expert-v5","status":"approved"}}
{"id":"v4_negative_example_003","chunk_id":"v4_negative_example_003","title":"反例：把说话人当负责人-1","content":"错误：产品说‘运营侧需要提供素材’，负责人写产品。正确：负责人应为运营侧。","metadata":{"runtime_layer":"RAG_DYNAMIC","layer":"boundary","scenario":"all","dimension":"action_items","knowledge_type":"negative_example","priority":"high","version":"2.1.1","dataset_version":"meeting_analyst_rag_v2_1_1","chunk_schema_version":"rag-chunk-v2.1.1","expert_review_version":"final-expert-v5","status":"approved"}}
{"id":"v4_negative_example_004","chunk_id":"v4_negative_example_004","title":"反例：错误传播 deadline-1","content":"错误：会议说‘8月1日上线’，就给所有待办填‘8月3日’。正确：任务时间必须有任务级绑定。","metadata":{"runtime_layer":"RAG_DYNAMIC","layer":"boundary","scenario":"all","dimension":"action_items","knowledge_type":"negative_example","priority":"high","version":"2.1.1","dataset_version":"meeting_analyst_rag_v2_1_1","chunk_schema_version":"rag-chunk-v2.1.1","expert_review_version":"final-expert-v5","status":"approved"}}
{"id":"v4_negative_example_005","chunk_id":"v4_negative_example_005","title":"反例：claim 和 source 不一致-1","content":"错误：claim 为‘取消推荐功能’，source 却引用‘历史数据兼容’。正确：证据片段必须直接支持该 claim；仅主题相关但语义不支持的片段不能作为证据。","metadata":{"runtime_layer":"RAG_DYNAMIC","layer":"boundary","scenario":"all","dimension":"evidence","knowledge_type":"negative_example","priority":"high","version":"2.1.1","dataset_version":"meeting_analyst_rag_v2_1_1","chunk_schema_version":"rag-chunk-v2.1.1","expert_review_version":"final-expert-v5","status":"approved"}}
{"id":"v4_negative_example_006","chunk_id":"v4_negative_example_006","title":"反例：编造会议事实-1","content":"错误：当前会议未讨论某项功能，却从 RAG 示例或历史会议中复制该事实。正确：RAG 示例只用于理解规则，输出事实必须来自当前会议原文。","metadata":{"runtime_layer":"RAG_DYNAMIC","layer":"boundary","scenario":"all","dimension":"evidence","knowledge_type":"negative_example","priority":"high","version":"2.1.1","dataset_version":"meeting_analyst_rag_v2_1_1","chunk_schema_version":"rag-chunk-v2.1.1","expert_review_version":"final-expert-v5","status":"approved"}}
{"id":"v4_negative_example_007","chunk_id":"v4_negative_example_007","title":"反例：风险和问题混淆-1","content":"错误：当前没有监控机制被写成未来风险。正确：机制缺失是遗留问题，差评持续导致掉权重才是风险。","metadata":{"runtime_layer":"RAG_DYNAMIC","layer":"boundary","scenario":"all","dimension":"cross_dimension","knowledge_type":"negative_example","priority":"high","version":"2.1.1","dataset_version":"meeting_analyst_rag_v2_1_1","chunk_schema_version":"rag-chunk-v2.1.1","expert_review_version":"final-expert-v5","status":"approved"}}
{"id":"v4_negative_example_008","chunk_id":"v4_negative_example_008","title":"反例：风险和待办混淆-1","content":"错误：‘转化起不来可能亏损’被写成待办。正确：这是风险；缩减预算只有明确决定执行时才是待办。","metadata":{"runtime_layer":"RAG_DYNAMIC","layer":"boundary","scenario":"all","dimension":"cross_dimension","knowledge_type":"negative_example","priority":"high","version":"2.1.1","dataset_version":"meeting_analyst_rag_v2_1_1","chunk_schema_version":"rag-chunk-v2.1.1","expert_review_version":"final-expert-v5","status":"approved"}}
{"id":"v4_negative_example_009","chunk_id":"v4_negative_example_009","title":"反例：沉默视为共识-1","content":"错误：某人提出方案后无人反对，就视为会议已确认。正确：沉默、话题切换或未回应均不等于共识；需要明确同意、确认、敲定或执行信号。","metadata":{"runtime_layer":"RAG_DYNAMIC","layer":"boundary","scenario":"all","dimension":"key_conclusions","knowledge_type":"negative_example","priority":"high","version":"2.1.1","dataset_version":"meeting_analyst_rag_v2_1_1","chunk_schema_version":"rag-chunk-v2.1.1","expert_review_version":"final-expert-v5","status":"approved"}}
{"id":"v4_negative_example_010","chunk_id":"v4_negative_example_010","title":"反例：合并不同负责人任务-1","content":"错误：把不同动作或不同责任主体的任务合并成一个待办。正确：按独立动作和责任主体拆分；同一负责人承担紧密相连的连续动作时，才可合并为一项。","metadata":{"runtime_layer":"RAG_DYNAMIC","layer":"boundary","scenario":"all","dimension":"action_items","knowledge_type":"negative_example","priority":"high","version":"2.1.1","dataset_version":"meeting_analyst_rag_v2_1_1","chunk_schema_version":"rag-chunk-v2.1.1","expert_review_version":"final-expert-v5","status":"approved"}}
{"id":"v4_owner_resolution_001","chunk_id":"v4_owner_resolution_001","title":"负责人：第一人称承诺-1","content":"‘我来、我负责、我今天补充’等第一人称承诺可将说话人识别为负责人，但必须同时存在明确动作对象。","metadata":{"runtime_layer":"POLICY_FIXED","layer":"base","scenario":"all","dimension":"action_items","knowledge_type":"owner_resolution","priority":"high","version":"2.1.1","dataset_version":"meeting_analyst_rag_v2_1_1","chunk_schema_version":"rag-chunk-v2.1.1","expert_review_version":"final-expert-v5","status":"approved"}}
{"id":"v4_owner_resolution_002","chunk_id":"v4_owner_resolution_002","title":"负责人：角色指向-1","content":"‘运营侧需要提供素材、由测试跟进’等角色指向可将被指向角色识别为负责人；角色应能与会议参与者或组织角色对应。","metadata":{"runtime_layer":"POLICY_FIXED","layer":"base","scenario":"all","dimension":"action_items","knowledge_type":"owner_resolution","priority":"high","version":"2.1.1","dataset_version":"meeting_analyst_rag_v2_1_1","chunk_schema_version":"rag-chunk-v2.1.1","expert_review_version":"final-expert-v5","status":"approved"}}
{"id":"v4_owner_resolution_003","chunk_id":"v4_owner_resolution_003","title":"负责人：第二人称指派-1","content":"‘你负责跟供应商确认’表示被指派者承担任务。只有对话参与关系能够明确解析‘你’时才填写具体负责人，否则保留角色级指向或 null。","metadata":{"runtime_layer":"POLICY_FIXED","layer":"base","scenario":"all","dimension":"action_items","knowledge_type":"owner_resolution","priority":"high","version":"2.1.1","dataset_version":"meeting_analyst_rag_v2_1_1","chunk_schema_version":"rag-chunk-v2.1.1","expert_review_version":"final-expert-v5","status":"approved"}}
{"id":"v4_owner_resolution_004","chunk_id":"v4_owner_resolution_004","title":"负责人：联合责任-1","content":"只有原文明确双方或多个角色分别承担具体动作时，才拆分联合责任。泛泛的‘双方确认、共同推进’不能自动生成多个待办。","metadata":{"runtime_layer":"POLICY_FIXED","layer":"base","scenario":"all","dimension":"action_items","knowledge_type":"owner_resolution","priority":"high","version":"2.1.1","dataset_version":"meeting_analyst_rag_v2_1_1","chunk_schema_version":"rag-chunk-v2.1.1","expert_review_version":"final-expert-v5","status":"approved"}}
{"id":"v4_owner_resolution_005","chunk_id":"v4_owner_resolution_005","title":"负责人：无负责人-1","content":"任务表达明确但没有承诺、指派或责任指向时，owner_name 保持 null；不得根据部门职责或说话人身份推测负责人。","metadata":{"runtime_layer":"POLICY_FIXED","layer":"base","scenario":"all","dimension":"action_items","knowledge_type":"owner_resolution","priority":"high","version":"2.1.1","dataset_version":"meeting_analyst_rag_v2_1_1","chunk_schema_version":"rag-chunk-v2.1.1","expert_review_version":"final-expert-v5","status":"approved"}}
{"id":"v4_positive_example_001","chunk_id":"v4_positive_example_001","title":"正例：产品研发会议-1","content":"产品说‘我今天补充验收标准并同步研发’，应提取待办：负责人为产品，任务为补充并同步验收标准，deadline 为今天。","metadata":{"runtime_layer":"RAG_SCENARIO","layer":"scenario","scenario":"requirement_review","dimension":"action_items","knowledge_type":"positive_example","priority":"high","version":"2.1.1","dataset_version":"meeting_analyst_rag_v2_1_1","chunk_schema_version":"rag-chunk-v2.1.1","expert_review_version":"final-expert-v5","status":"approved"}}
{"id":"v4_positive_example_002","chunk_id":"v4_positive_example_002","title":"正例：电商运营会议-1","content":"客户经理说‘我会整理客户提供的竞品资料和需求清单，今天同步给产品’，应提取待办：负责人为客户经理，任务为整理并同步资料与需求清单，deadline 为今天。","metadata":{"runtime_layer":"RAG_SCENARIO","layer":"scenario","scenario":"customer_requirement","dimension":"action_items","knowledge_type":"positive_example","priority":"high","version":"2.1.1","dataset_version":"meeting_analyst_rag_v2_1_1","chunk_schema_version":"rag-chunk-v2.1.1","expert_review_version":"final-expert-v5","status":"approved"}}
{"id":"v4_positive_example_003","chunk_id":"v4_positive_example_003","title":"正例：销售复盘会议-1","content":"客户经理说‘本周五前我把重点客户需求清单发给大家’，应提取待办：负责人为客户经理，deadline 为本周五前。","metadata":{"runtime_layer":"RAG_SCENARIO","layer":"scenario","scenario":"customer_requirement","dimension":"action_items","knowledge_type":"positive_example","priority":"high","version":"2.1.1","dataset_version":"meeting_analyst_rag_v2_1_1","chunk_schema_version":"rag-chunk-v2.1.1","expert_review_version":"final-expert-v5","status":"approved"}}
{"id":"v4_positive_example_004","chunk_id":"v4_positive_example_004","title":"正例：市场营销会议-1","content":"管理层明确确认‘下月减少低效渠道预算，将资源转向高优先级项目’，应提取核心结论；只有另有明确执行指派时，才生成相应待办。","metadata":{"runtime_layer":"RAG_SCENARIO","layer":"scenario","scenario":"management_decision","dimension":"key_conclusions","knowledge_type":"positive_example","priority":"high","version":"2.1.1","dataset_version":"meeting_analyst_rag_v2_1_1","chunk_schema_version":"rag-chunk-v2.1.1","expert_review_version":"final-expert-v5","status":"approved"}}
{"id":"v4_positive_example_005","chunk_id":"v4_positive_example_005","title":"正例：客户成功会议-1","content":"原文‘目前没有客户需求优先级评估机制’，且会议未形成建设方案或执行安排，应提取遗留问题，不自动生成‘建立评估机制’待办。","metadata":{"runtime_layer":"RAG_SCENARIO","layer":"scenario","scenario":"customer_requirement","dimension":"unresolved_issues","knowledge_type":"positive_example","priority":"high","version":"2.1.1","dataset_version":"meeting_analyst_rag_v2_1_1","chunk_schema_version":"rag-chunk-v2.1.1","expert_review_version":"final-expert-v5","status":"approved"}}
{"id":"v4_positive_example_006","chunk_id":"v4_positive_example_006","title":"正例：供应链会议-1","content":"跨部门会议明确确认‘依赖资料完成后再上线’，可记录为条件性安排；依赖资料尚未完成同时属于遗留问题。不得把条件时间伪造成具体日期。","metadata":{"runtime_layer":"RAG_SCENARIO","layer":"scenario","scenario":"cross_team_coordination","dimension":"cross_dimension","knowledge_type":"positive_example","priority":"high","version":"2.1.1","dataset_version":"meeting_analyst_rag_v2_1_1","chunk_schema_version":"rag-chunk-v2.1.1","expert_review_version":"final-expert-v5","status":"approved"}}
{"id":"v4_positive_example_007","chunk_id":"v4_positive_example_007","title":"正例：技术运维会议-1","content":"原文‘如果磁盘使用率继续上涨，可能导致服务不可写’，应提取风险，impact 为服务不可写。","metadata":{"runtime_layer":"RAG_SCENARIO","layer":"scenario","scenario":"technical_incident","dimension":"risks_and_focus","knowledge_type":"positive_example","priority":"high","version":"2.1.1","dataset_version":"meeting_analyst_rag_v2_1_1","chunk_schema_version":"rag-chunk-v2.1.1","expert_review_version":"final-expert-v5","status":"approved"}}
{"id":"v4_positive_example_008","chunk_id":"v4_positive_example_008","title":"正例：人力资源会议-1","content":"协调人说‘测试团队需要周三前提交回归范围’，负责人是测试团队，不是提出要求的协调人。","metadata":{"runtime_layer":"RAG_SCENARIO","layer":"scenario","scenario":"cross_team_coordination","dimension":"action_items","knowledge_type":"positive_example","priority":"high","version":"2.1.1","dataset_version":"meeting_analyst_rag_v2_1_1","chunk_schema_version":"rag-chunk-v2.1.1","expert_review_version":"final-expert-v5","status":"approved"}}
{"id":"v4_positive_example_009","chunk_id":"v4_positive_example_009","title":"正例：财务经营会议-1","content":"原文‘如果回款继续延期，会影响现金流’，应提取风险：回款延期影响现金流。","metadata":{"runtime_layer":"RAG_SCENARIO","layer":"scenario","scenario":"management_decision","dimension":"risks_and_focus","knowledge_type":"positive_example","priority":"high","version":"2.1.1","dataset_version":"meeting_analyst_rag_v2_1_1","chunk_schema_version":"rag-chunk-v2.1.1","expert_review_version":"final-expert-v5","status":"approved"}}
{"id":"v4_positive_example_010","chunk_id":"v4_positive_example_010","title":"正例：项目管理会议-1","content":"双方说‘需求本周冻结，不再接受临时变更’，应提取核心结论。","metadata":{"runtime_layer":"RAG_SCENARIO","layer":"scenario","scenario":"release_planning","dimension":"key_conclusions","knowledge_type":"positive_example","priority":"high","version":"2.1.1","dataset_version":"meeting_analyst_rag_v2_1_1","chunk_schema_version":"rag-chunk-v2.1.1","expert_review_version":"final-expert-v5","status":"approved"}}
{"id":"v4_reasoning_pattern_003","chunk_id":"v4_reasoning_pattern_003","title":"推理：条件风险链-1","content":"按‘触发条件 → 未来不利事件 → 影响结果’识别风险。应对措施不得混入风险本体；只有会议明确决定执行时，才单独生成待办。","metadata":{"runtime_layer":"RAG_DYNAMIC","layer":"boundary","scenario":"all","dimension":"risks_and_focus","knowledge_type":"reasoning_pattern","priority":"high","version":"2.1.1","dataset_version":"meeting_analyst_rag_v2_1_1","chunk_schema_version":"rag-chunk-v2.1.1","expert_review_version":"final-expert-v5","status":"approved"}}
{"id":"v4_reasoning_pattern_007","chunk_id":"v4_reasoning_pattern_007","title":"推理：跨轮次指代-1","content":"‘没问题，我来处理’只能在相邻轮次、同一主题、上一轮任务对象唯一且承诺关系清晰时恢复动作对象。跨主题、多人候选或指代不清时，不得强行关联。","metadata":{"runtime_layer":"RAG_DYNAMIC","layer":"boundary","scenario":"all","dimension":"action_items","knowledge_type":"reasoning_pattern","priority":"high","version":"2.1.1","dataset_version":"meeting_analyst_rag_v2_1_1","chunk_schema_version":"rag-chunk-v2.1.1","expert_review_version":"final-expert-v5","status":"approved"}}
{"id":"v4_reasoning_pattern_008","chunk_id":"v4_reasoning_pattern_008","title":"推理：阶段性取舍-1","content":"‘本月先做A，B长期搁置’中，只有会议明确确认优先级时，A优先可形成阶段性结论；A存在具体执行安排时再生成待办；B在仍未解决时进入遗留问题。","metadata":{"runtime_layer":"RAG_DYNAMIC","layer":"boundary","scenario":"all","dimension":"cross_dimension","knowledge_type":"reasoning_pattern","priority":"high","version":"2.1.1","dataset_version":"meeting_analyst_rag_v2_1_1","chunk_schema_version":"rag-chunk-v2.1.1","expert_review_version":"final-expert-v5","status":"approved"}}
